  "body": "The SharedWorker always needs to perform a same-origin check since\nalthough with modules the URL itself can be cross-origin, the origin of\nthe global of the WorkerGlobalScope needs to be same-origin.\n\nThis also cleans up “set up a worker environment settings object” with\na more explicit way of referencing the needed environment settings\nobject.\n\nThis regressed through #339 (though that change also had to be made for\nmodule workers).\n\nFixes #1321.\n",
